# Yew WASM UI experiment. Pins default_target_platform to //platforms:wasm so the
# native `buck2 build //src/...` CI sweep cross-compiles this to wasm instead of
# trying (and failing) to build it for the host. See
# docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-30-yew-wasm-ui-experiment-design.md.

